SFP-48769 - Update Flow to only include Active Pricebooks

SFP-SFP-51476 - Opportunity Flow fixes as per PR - Opportunity Flow

SFP-51454 - Modifying Opportunity Flow to skip Insurance experience site opportunities when assigning Price Books</description>
